    <innerclass refid="classthemis_1_1llm_1_1_i_l_l_m_resource_policy" prot="public">themis::llm::ILLMResourcePolicy</innerclass>
    <innernamespace refid="namespacethemis">themis</innernamespace>
    <innernamespace refid="namespacethemis_1_1llm">themis::llm</innernamespace>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract LLM resource-limit policy for ThemisDB inference paths. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Governs per-inference context-token budgets, the number of concurrently loaded model instances, and per-model VRAM allocation ceilings. The policy sits in Tier 2 of the four-tier resource-governance chain:</para>
<para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">compile-time<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">constexpr</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(edition.h)<sp/><sp/><sp/>←<sp/>absolute<sp/>ceiling,<sp/>never<sp/>overridable</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">RuntimeLicenseGate<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>←<sp/>edition-tier<sp/>ceiling</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">ILLMResourcePolicy<sp/><sp/>(</highlight><highlight class="keyword">this</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>file)<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>←<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">signed</highlight><highlight class="normal">-plugin<sp/>fine-tuning</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">LLMResourceConfig<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>←<sp/>per-deployment<sp/>operational<sp/>tuning</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>All implementations must be individually thread-safe.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>This interface is part of the edition-policy plugin contract (IEditionPolicyPlugin::createLLMResourcePolicy). Claimed limits are validated against the compile-time ceilings edition::LLM_MAX_CONTEXT_TOKENS, edition::LLM_MAX_MODEL_INSTANCES, and edition::LLM_MAX_VRAM_PER_MODEL_MB before a policy is accepted. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
